  "notes": "15 buses ordered in 2018 by RDT 13 for the 7.2 km L'Aixpress route (19 stops, every 5 min), deliveries due April-September 2019; charged at opportunity charging stations and overnight at the Pont de l'Arc depot (charging power/time not given). Standing at 4 per m². Dimensions, floor height, turning circle and nominal motor power (185 kW synchronous) are from the current Irizar ie tram 12 m data sheet (battery options 90/470/510 kWh; pantograph up to 300-450 kW, Combo2 150 kW; max. 105 passengers), which may differ from the 2019 Aix vehicles; their battery size is not published. Axle positions derived from the sheet: front overhang 2,805 mm, wheelbase 5,955 mm. Total capacity not published; seated + standing = 100."
